Vendored third-party assets for the Blackout Beacon offline map (/map).
Everything in this directory is served locally — no CDN, no internet at
serve time. Downloaded during the briefing phase (2026-08-22).

maplibre-gl.js, maplibre-gl.css
  MapLibre GL JS v4.7.1 (pinned: last WebGL1-compatible major, for old phones)
  https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-gl-js
  License: BSD-3-Clause

pmtiles.js
  PMTiles JS v4.5.0 (UMD build, global `pmtiles`)
  https://github.com/protomaps/PMTiles
  License: BSD-3-Clause

basemaps.js
  @protomaps/basemaps v5.7.2 (UMD build, global `basemaps`)
  Generates the MapLibre style layers for the Protomaps basemap
  (flavor: dark). Verified compatible with the vendored tileset
  (source-layer names match data/london.pmtiles, schema 4.15.2).
  https://github.com/protomaps/basemaps
  License: BSD-3-Clause

fonts/
  Glyph PBFs from https://github.com/protomaps/basemaps-assets
  Stacks: Noto Sans Regular, Noto Sans Medium, Noto Sans Italic,
  Noto Sans Devanagari Regular v1 (all stacks referenced by the style).
  Fonts: Noto Sans — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see fonts/OFL.txt)

sprites/v4/
  "dark" flavor spritesheets from protomaps/basemaps-assets
  License: BSD-3-Clause (part of the basemaps project)

Map data (data/london.pmtiles):
  (c) OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL) + Natural Earth.
  Attribution is displayed on the map UI.
